4. RESEARCH SOFTWARE NOTICE — NOT A MEDICAL DEVICE
===============================================================================

radpareto-engine is RESEARCH SOFTWARE provided exclusively for academic
research, medical physics education, algorithm benchmarking, and phantom
metrology prototyping.

IT IS NOT A MEDICAL DEVICE, HAS NOT BEEN CLEARED OR APPROVED BY THE U.S. FDA,
EU MDR, OR ANY OTHER REGULATORY AUTHORITY, AND MUST NOT BE USED FOR CLINICAL
DIAGNOSIS, TREATMENT PLANNING, AUTOMATED PATIENT EXPOSURE CONTROL, PATIENT
PROTOCOL MODIFICATION WITHOUT QUALIFIED MEDICAL PHYSICIST (QMP) COMMISSIONING,
OR CLINICAL DOSIMETRY REPORTING.

All protocol recommendations, detectability indices (d'), SSDE surrogates,
in-vivo metrology metrics, and Peak Skin Dose (PSD) estimates produced by this
Software require independent verification against commissioned clinical
dosimeters, calibrated phantom measurements, and institutional radiation safety
governance.

